*> ********************************************************
*> PROGRAM : CRD0027
*> PURPOSE : CREDIT APPROVAL RULES
*> AUTHOR  : R.T.
*> CHANGE LOG:
*>   1992-09-15 ORIGINAL VERSION
*>   1998-11-05 THRESHOLDS UPDATED PER AUDIT REQ 746
*> RUN FROM JCL JOB CRDNIGHT STEP060
*> ********************************************************
IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. CRD0027.
DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01 WS-INPUT.
    *> BUREAU CREDIT SCORE
    05 BUREAU-SCORE       PIC 9(3).
    05 ANN-INCOME         PIC 9(7)V99.
01 RESULT-AREA.
    05 CREDIT-LIMIT       PIC 9(7)V99 VALUE ZERO.
PROCEDURE DIVISION.
MAINLINE.
    ACCEPT WS-INPUT
    PERFORM ASSIGN-LIMIT
    DISPLAY "CREDIT-LIMIT=" CREDIT-LIMIT
    STOP RUN.
ASSIGN-LIMIT.
    EVALUATE TRUE
        WHEN BUREAU-SCORE NOT < 750
            COMPUTE CREDIT-LIMIT = ANN-INCOME * 0.25
        *> STANDARD CREDIT LIMIT
        WHEN BUREAU-SCORE NOT < 680
            COMPUTE CREDIT-LIMIT = ANN-INCOME * 0.20
        WHEN OTHER
            MOVE 500 TO CREDIT-LIMIT
    END-EVALUATE.
